: "secondary_7"}, {"content": "Understands general and detailed information as well as attitude and intention on a wide range of general topics, in conversations or presentations, spoken at a natural speed and in circumstances that make it more difficult to hear. ", "type": "secondary_8"}], "type": "objectives"}, {"content": "engenn9le01ob09re1img01.jpg", "type": "background_image"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Using Causative Verbs <span class=\"italic\">To Get</span> and <span class=\"italic\">To Have</span>.", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "You use the causative with <span class=\"strong\">have</span> and <span class=\"strong\">get</span> to show that you want someone to do something for you.  You cause the person to do something.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "<span class=\"underline\">Causative Form with Have</span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":2,\"columns\":5,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Subject\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" have\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" agent\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" base form of the main verb\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" object\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">I </span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">had better have</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">my accountant</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">look </span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">at everything ... </span>\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}", "type": "table"}, {"content": "<span class=\"underline\">Causative Form with Get</span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":4,\"columns\":5,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Subject\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"get\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"agent\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"infinitive form of the main verb\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"object\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">You </span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">can get </span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">your friends </span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">to help </span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\"> You. </span>\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}", "type": "table"}, {"content": " I<span class=\"strong\">'d better have</span> my accountant <span class=\"strong\">look</span> at everything including my investments.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "It's heartwarming when you <span class=\"strong\">can get</span> your friends <span class=\"strong\">to help</span> you, right Peter?", "type": "example"}, {"content": "Yup, and that's why I<span class=\"strong\">'m getting</span> you both <span class=\"strong\">to help </span> me clean this apartment. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "How about we <span class=\"strong\">get</span> them <span class=\"strong\">to dust and sweep and mop</span> all the floors?", "type": "example"}, {"content": "Would it be asking too much <span class=\"strong\">to have</span> someone <span class=\"strong\">reorganize</span> the kitchen cupboards?", "type": "example"}, {"content": "<span class=\"strong\">Could</span> we <span class=\"strong\">have</span> the windows washed?", "type": "example"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Present Continuous Tense", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "Present Continuous tense is used to talk about an action that is happening or in progress at the moment. ", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "When you use Present Continuous tense, you can use contractions. You use them often in speaking.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "<span class=\"italic\">\u2018It is heartwarming' </span> becomes <span class=\"italic\">\u2018It's heartwarming'.</span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "<span class=\"italic\">\u2018I am getting'  </span>becomes<span class=\"italic\"> \u2018I'm getting'.</span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "<span class=\"italic\">\u2018You are staying' </span>becomes<span class=\"italic\"> \u2018You're staying'.</span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "These renovations <span class=\"strong\">are eating</span> a hole in my wallet!", "type": "example"}, {"content": "At least you <span class=\"strong\">are staying</span> at the Peter hotel rather than paying an exorbitant amount somewhere else!", "type": "example"}, {"content": " It<span class=\"strong\">'s heartwarming</span> when you can get your friends to help you, right Peter?", "type": "example"}, {"content": "Yup, and that's why I<span class=\"strong\">'m getting</span> you both to help me clean this apartment. ", "type": "example"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"content": "to put away", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to save", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example:  I had the foresight to put some money away.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn9le01ob09aud02", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "These are words you use when we talk about repairing a house.", "type": "text"}], "type": "target_word_describer"}, {"contents": [{"content": "to eat a hole in my wallet", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to spend more money than the person estimated ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(expression)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: These renovations are eating a hole in my wallet!", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn9le01ob09aud03", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "exorbitant", "type": "name"}, {"content": "going beyond what is customary, proper, or reasonable in amount ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective) ", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: At least you are staying at the Peter hotel rather than paying an exorbitant amount somewhere else!", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn9le01ob09aud04", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "to put (object)  up", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to invite or allow someone to stay at your home", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(expression) ", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Thanks for putting us up like this.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn9le01ob09aud05", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "to keep track of", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to maintain a record ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(expression) ", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I can't even keep track of the money I'm spending. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn9le01ob09aud06", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "to mop", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to use water to clean, especially on a floor", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb) ", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example:  How about we get them to dust and sweep and mop all the floors?", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn9le01ob09aud07", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "to draw the line", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to set a limit on something", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(expression) ", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I think that is where I would draw the line. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn9le01ob09aud08", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "foresight", "type": "name"}, {"content": "care or provision for the future", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun) ", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I had the foresight to put some money away in case I need it in the future. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn9le01ob09aud01", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Look around your house and think about all the repairs and cleaning that need to be done.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Find two companies that you could get to do those repairs and find out the cost.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Write a paragraph of 150 words choosing the service you would prefer to use and why.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Share your writing with a friend.", "type": "text"}], "type": "takeaway_extension"}, {"contents": [{"content": "I identify household repairs that need to be done.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I research two companies that do the repairs.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I write a paragraph explaining which company I would choose to fix the problem.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I share my writing with a friend.", "type": "text"}], "type": "takeaway_assessment"}], "labs": [{"stimuli": [{"template_override": 1, "contents": [{}], "_data": [], "id": 0, "type": "welcome"}, {"template_override": 1, "_data": [], "title": "", "type": "audio", "contents": [{"value": {"images": [{"image": "engenn9le01ob09re2img05.jpg", "time": "0", "id": 0, "text": ""}, {"image": "engenn9le01ob09re2img05.jpg", "time": "100", "id": 1, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: I'm glad I had the foresight to put some money away. These renovations are eating a hole in my wallet!\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Tell me about it! First I had a leaky roof, then there was the flood and now I need to get someone to rip up the floors and replace them! I can't even keep track of the money I'm spending. In fact, I'd better have my accountant look at everything including my investments.\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>:  At least you are staying at the Peter hotel rather than paying an exorbitant amount somewhere else!\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: It's true. Thanks for putting us up like this.\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: It's heartwarming when you can get your friends to help you, right Peter?"}, {"image": "engenn9le01ob09re2img01.jpg", "time": "35000", "id": 2, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: Yup, and that's why I'm getting you both to help me clean this apartment. It's pretty untidy with the three of us here ... speaking of which, how long do you guys think you are likely to stay?\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: I think it'll be one week more for me. Sally?\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Ummm. Two. Maybe three.\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: Okay ...\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: I have an idea. While I stay with you why don't I get a cleaning service to come and clean for us once a week?\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: Could we have the windows washed?\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Sure!"}, {"image": "engenn9le01ob09re2img02.jpg", "time": "67000", "id": 3, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: How about we get them to dust and sweep and mop all the floors?\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Of course! That's what they're hired to do.\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: Would it be asking too much to have someone reorganize the kitchen cupboards?\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: I think that is where I would draw the line. That's not normally what a cleaning service does.\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Besides, you are looking at the queen of organization!"}], "audiosrc": "engenn9le01ob09re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn9le01ob09re2img05.jpg"}, "type": "slideshow"}], "id": 1}], "exercise